* text=auto eol=lf

*.rs text
*.py text
*.pyi text
*.html text
*.js text
*.css text
*.svelte text
*.toml text
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.snap text

# Vector basemap data: a hundred kilobytes that every clone and every CI job needs, so it
# is a Git blob. data/README.md says so.
*.geojson text

*.png binary
*.bin binary
# A decimated raster small enough to commit is sanctioned (platform.md "Testing"), and the
# geo-data-registered hook passes one that has a registry row — so these two are load-bearing for the
# raster this repository would really commit. Without them `text=auto` above decides, and a raster it
# guessed wrong about is line-ending mangled.
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
